00:06:30.927 --> 00:06:32.968
<v Host>It means a contribution.

00:06:33.567 --> 00:06:45.447
<v Slow>松島選手は3年前、世界ランキングで151位でしたが、少しずつ順位を上げてきました。

00:06:46.247 --> 00:06:51.959
<v Host>Three years ago he was ranked one hundred fifty-first, but he climbed little by little.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.791
